{
  "_note": [
    "The server's side of one cycle, for tools/host-stub.py to replay in CI (docs/host.md).",
    "",
    "CI cannot run meshmaster.dk: no image of it is published and its own tests need MySQL. So this",
    "file is the exchanges a run needs - the config call, the heartbeat reply, the claims in the",
    "order the server hands them out, and what each result must come back as - and the stub answers",
    "them over plain HTTP on a loopback port.",
    "",
    "Redacted on purpose, and checked by the stub: the token is the placeholder below and never a",
    "real one, and the only passwords in the file are the fake repeaters' own",
    "(tests/fixtures/host/two-repeaters.json). Nothing here is anybody's secret.",
    "",
    "Refreshed by `tools/host-run.ps1 -Record` against the compose stack on a workstation. The",
    "`budget` is the one place this is deliberately not the server's: 60 a minute with no gap, so a",
    "cycle of eighty-odd transactions is a minute and not seven hours. The pacing arithmetic itself",
    "is exercised against the stack, where the budget is the server's own (docs/host.md)."
  ],
  "token": "mma_hostharnessplaceholdertokennotarealone0",
  "exitNodeKey": "f7b8f191d0aa0d23976459c419f2d131371f1caecaef35289295f803078f2442",
  "repeater1": "0f1ba04635a8ca8ca4699225f3f3bbe816cc955c97a49d07e0c6967e79985c78",
